259
00:13:49,504 --> 00:13:49,903
Ha tabii

260
00:13:49,903 --> 00:13:50,344
yani

261
00:13:50,344 --> 00:13:51,303
Tanzimat gerçekten

262
00:13:51,303 --> 00:13:51,723
sadece

263
00:13:51,723 --> 00:13:53,183
bu tarz

264
00:13:53,183 --> 00:13:54,423
kolay bir

265
