278
00:14:08,183 --> 00:14:08,384
Ve

279
00:14:08,384 --> 00:14:09,223
işte

280
00:14:09,223 --> 00:14:10,483
Riyal Paşa

281
00:14:10,483 --> 00:14:11,703
Namık Kemal

282
00:14:11,703 --> 00:14:12,703
