289
00:14:17,983 --> 00:14:18,943
figürleri.

290
00:14:19,443 --> 00:14:20,283
Ama özellikle

291
00:14:20,283 --> 00:14:21,144
kamuoyunda

292
00:14:21,144 --> 00:14:22,264
